WEBVTT

00:16.474 --> 00:17.809
Father,

00:17.892 --> 00:20.103
my incarceration has taught me

00:20.186 --> 00:23.356
how foolish I had been in the past.

00:23.440 --> 00:25.900
I couldn't restrain my greed

00:25.984 --> 00:27.944
and continued to steal.

00:28.528 --> 00:29.946
I'm ashamed of myself.

00:30.905 --> 00:32.657
It's all thanks to you, Father.

00:33.408 --> 00:37.829
Could I please ask for your assistance
in receiving parole?

00:38.371 --> 00:39.998
Recent studies have revealed…

00:41.791 --> 00:43.168
that proper training

00:43.251 --> 00:46.629
can teach even dogs and parrots
how to read, utilize fire,

00:47.130 --> 00:49.716
and understand art.

00:49.799 --> 00:51.134
If that is the case,

00:51.217 --> 00:54.179
then what is the difference
between man and animal?

00:54.763 --> 00:56.139
What do you think?

00:56.848 --> 00:57.932
I'm not sure.

00:58.600 --> 01:00.852
Anyway, about my parole…

01:01.478 --> 01:02.562
Excuse me.

01:05.899 --> 01:06.858
-Hey.
-Got it.

01:10.445 --> 01:11.446
The point is,

01:12.072 --> 01:15.450
after finishing the first cherry
and leaving it in your mouth,

01:15.533 --> 01:17.952
which tooth would you
bite the second with?

01:18.787 --> 01:23.374
You must not bite the first pit
while eating the second cherry.

01:23.458 --> 01:24.459
Sure…

01:24.542 --> 01:27.462
And what about my parole?

01:29.589 --> 01:31.633
I think there's a possibility.

01:31.716 --> 01:33.176
Do you really, Father?

01:33.259 --> 01:35.970
I will recommend you to the committee.

01:37.263 --> 01:38.681
Thank you, Fa--

01:43.728 --> 01:44.979
I quite like

01:46.189 --> 01:48.066
your mischievous habit of theft.

01:50.276 --> 01:52.654
Truly, an evil disposition
cannot be corrected.

01:52.737 --> 01:53.571
However,

01:54.280 --> 01:56.825
I cannot deny this talent.

01:57.325 --> 01:59.285
You will prove useful to me.

01:59.369 --> 02:02.122
I cannot let Jotaro's Stand

02:02.205 --> 02:04.874
leave this prison, after all.

03:39.844 --> 03:43.973
EPISODE 9: DEBT COLLECTOR MARY LYNN MANSON

03:44.515 --> 03:45.808
What the hell?

03:45.892 --> 03:48.478
What do you mean F.F. is hiding it?

03:49.229 --> 03:52.857
It's an important disc
containing your father's Stand, right?

03:52.941 --> 03:55.818
Are you fine with not knowing
where she's hiding it?

03:55.902 --> 03:58.738
-How do we know we can--
-This place is fun!

03:58.821 --> 04:01.324
-It's not like the wetlands at all!
-Really, now.

04:03.284 --> 04:05.203
I want to play too.

04:05.745 --> 04:07.247
It's called "catch," right?

04:08.248 --> 04:10.375
I trust F.F.,

04:10.959 --> 04:14.295
and Pale Snake doesn't know
that she's alive.

04:15.046 --> 04:16.339
It's the safest place.

04:17.423 --> 04:18.299
You're right.

04:18.383 --> 04:19.801
But it would be even better

04:20.593 --> 04:23.263
if you could deliver the disc to him.

04:23.346 --> 04:24.264
I know.

04:24.347 --> 04:28.977
But I'm not allowed visitors or
phone calls because I attempted to escape.

04:29.060 --> 04:31.229
And I don't have a plan
to carry it out yet.

04:34.524 --> 04:36.150
Hey, you!

04:36.776 --> 04:38.152
That's my drink!

04:38.820 --> 04:40.989
What's the matter with you?

04:41.072 --> 04:43.241
I'm thirsty.

04:43.324 --> 04:47.704
Put that cup back on the bench now!

04:47.787 --> 04:50.915
If it's that important to you,
then don't put it down.

04:50.999 --> 04:52.583
Especially in here.

04:56.462 --> 04:58.756
F.F., I'll bring you more water!

04:58.840 --> 05:00.925
Don't cause any trouble!

05:16.149 --> 05:17.483
Give it back!

05:18.192 --> 05:19.861
Oh, well.

05:19.944 --> 05:22.905
I ended up with more water. Lucky me!

05:27.076 --> 05:27.910
All right,

05:28.995 --> 05:30.455
let's get back to playing.

05:30.538 --> 05:31.873
-Jeez.
-What?

05:31.956 --> 05:34.876
You've never thrown a ball, have you?

05:36.502 --> 05:37.337
Oh, crap.

05:46.054 --> 05:47.638
Tuck your hips in.

05:48.264 --> 05:49.182
A bit more.

05:49.766 --> 05:50.892
You got it.

05:51.976 --> 05:54.062
Your form's looking better already.

05:55.646 --> 05:57.106
Jolyne, did you know

05:57.899 --> 06:00.360
that we've tossed the ball 86 times now?

06:00.443 --> 06:02.028
We haven't dropped it at all.

06:02.111 --> 06:03.654
Think we can reach a hundred?

06:05.198 --> 06:07.075
A hundred dollars says it won't last.

06:09.202 --> 06:10.703
I bet 100 dollars.

06:11.287 --> 06:14.040
Sorry, but who are you?
What do you mean 100 dollars?

06:14.624 --> 06:16.042
I'm Miraschon,

06:16.125 --> 06:19.712
inmate FE26789.

06:19.796 --> 06:21.464
I'm betting 100 dollars

06:21.547 --> 06:25.885
that you won't be able to
make it to the 100th throw.

06:26.511 --> 06:29.597
Where did that come from, all of a sudden?

06:30.181 --> 06:31.766
I'm just killing time.

06:38.356 --> 06:39.690
Let's do it!

06:39.774 --> 06:41.275
We only have 13 more throws!

06:41.359 --> 06:42.735
You keep quiet!

06:44.070 --> 06:47.615
I don't have that kind of money.

06:47.698 --> 06:49.033
I can't match this wager.

06:49.117 --> 06:51.035
You can bet any item.

06:51.119 --> 06:52.662
Tobacco, drugs,

06:52.745 --> 06:55.706
gum, a phone call, a vibrator…

06:56.207 --> 06:58.501
I'll accept anything valuable.

06:58.584 --> 06:59.752
Let me be frank.

07:00.253 --> 07:02.338
I'm not betting on anything.

07:02.422 --> 07:03.756
Hold it.

07:03.840 --> 07:05.091
Jolyne,

07:06.092 --> 07:07.844
we should accept this bet.

07:07.927 --> 07:09.429
It's a chance to make money.

07:09.929 --> 07:11.681
You can use my money.

07:12.682 --> 07:16.185
F.F. might suck at playing catch,
but still managed to continue to 87.

07:16.269 --> 07:17.103
We can win!

07:17.645 --> 07:18.771
Come on, Ermes.

07:18.855 --> 07:21.691
You suspect that this is
Pale Snake's trap.

07:22.525 --> 07:26.195
But I know that Miraschon
because we're on the same floor.

07:26.279 --> 07:29.991
She's the greedy self-destructive type
that kept committing petty theft.

07:30.616 --> 07:31.701
Think about it.

07:32.493 --> 07:34.829
Even after your restrictions get lifted,

07:34.912 --> 07:38.332
you need to buy your time on the phone.

07:38.958 --> 07:39.917
So,

07:40.501 --> 07:41.544
gonna play or not?

07:41.627 --> 07:44.589
I want to give it a go! We can win this!

07:44.672 --> 07:45.923
Good.

07:47.008 --> 07:49.051
But you don't have 100 dollars, do you?

07:54.599 --> 07:59.729
If you raise your voice or get too close,
the bet is immediately off.

07:59.812 --> 08:00.646
Got it?

08:01.272 --> 08:03.107
The wager has already begun.

08:03.691 --> 08:05.359
But it wouldn't be fair for me

08:05.443 --> 08:08.154
if you play too close
or hold onto the ball too long.

08:08.237 --> 08:11.240
We'll stay at least three meters away
and throw within ten seconds.

08:12.116 --> 08:13.075
Good.

08:15.453 --> 08:17.830
Time to play ball! Let's go.

08:17.914 --> 08:19.790
Don't rush and take your aim.

08:19.874 --> 08:22.668
You have a whole ten seconds
before you throw!

08:23.586 --> 08:25.046
Eighty-nine.

08:26.464 --> 08:28.633
Only 11 more throws to go!

08:29.342 --> 08:32.845
Bitch, stay away from my cup!

08:33.429 --> 08:34.555
F.F.!

08:36.849 --> 08:38.184
That was close.

08:38.267 --> 08:40.102
Come on, focus!

08:40.186 --> 08:41.229
It wasn't my fault!

08:41.312 --> 08:44.815
It's her! She got near my water!

08:45.399 --> 08:47.068
I'm just enjoying the show.

08:47.151 --> 08:49.612
Just stay away from my cup!

08:50.613 --> 08:51.572
All right.

08:52.240 --> 08:53.074
Five more seconds.

08:53.157 --> 08:54.825
F.F., throw the ball!

08:54.909 --> 08:57.203
-Damn, she's distracting me!
-Hey!

08:57.286 --> 08:59.288
I'll hold your cup for you.

08:59.372 --> 09:01.374
-One second left.
-F.F.!

09:03.251 --> 09:04.293
Idiot!

09:09.048 --> 09:09.966
Jolyne!

09:13.511 --> 09:15.805
That was close, but she caught it.

09:15.888 --> 09:17.682
Sorry, I panicked.

09:19.725 --> 09:21.936
Be careful next time, F.F.

09:22.019 --> 09:23.604
I'm fine now!

09:26.023 --> 09:28.150
See? A hundred throws!

09:28.234 --> 09:29.068
Good.

09:30.611 --> 09:33.322
I can go another hundred throws!

09:33.406 --> 09:35.408
See? An easy win.

09:35.491 --> 09:36.993
Now, give us the 100 dollars.

09:37.076 --> 09:39.912
Hold on, she made a wager with F.F. too.

09:39.996 --> 09:41.706
That makes it 200 dollars.

09:41.789 --> 09:44.375
That's true. She owes us 200 dollars.

09:44.458 --> 09:45.918
Now, cough it up.

09:47.378 --> 09:50.172
A thousand dollars
if you throw a hundred more.

09:53.801 --> 09:55.011
You heard me.

09:55.094 --> 09:57.346
I said let's play for 1,000 dollars.

09:57.930 --> 09:58.806
Are you serious?

09:58.889 --> 10:00.641
Do you even have that much money?

10:00.725 --> 10:01.559
Of course, I do.

10:02.059 --> 10:03.603
But like I said,

10:03.686 --> 10:05.771
I'll take anything valuable too.

10:06.731 --> 10:08.899
The rules will be the same as last time.

10:08.983 --> 10:10.026
What do you say?

10:10.818 --> 10:12.653
No, I'm done playing with you.

10:15.072 --> 10:16.365
I'm going to be frank.

10:16.449 --> 10:18.701
There's something I don't like about you.

10:20.411 --> 10:23.205
-If you want to wager, go play else--
-I'll play.

10:23.789 --> 10:24.832
Good.

10:24.915 --> 10:27.585
F.F., hand me the glove and the ball.

10:27.668 --> 10:28.711
-Okay!
-Ermes, no!

10:29.879 --> 10:33.132
Jolyne, you're right, she is suspicious.

10:33.215 --> 10:35.718
Especially the way she insists on betting.

10:35.801 --> 10:36.636
But…

10:38.179 --> 10:41.390
we can potentially make 1,200 dollars.

10:41.474 --> 10:43.684
There's no way we can pass that up.

10:43.768 --> 10:45.061
Be careful, though.

10:45.144 --> 10:49.106
The game begins
the moment you agree to play.

10:49.649 --> 10:50.900
Might be 10 seconds soon.

10:50.983 --> 10:52.610
-Ermes!
-F.F.!

10:55.154 --> 10:56.322
More easy money.

11:03.079 --> 11:04.121
Thirty.

11:05.039 --> 11:06.248
Thirty-one.

11:07.083 --> 11:08.209
Thirty-two.

11:09.210 --> 11:11.545
Great, the next one makes it 33.

11:13.047 --> 11:15.841
Inmates, put away your exercise equipment!

11:15.925 --> 11:18.010
Recess time is over!

11:20.304 --> 11:21.722
Five…

11:23.015 --> 11:24.392
F.F.!

11:24.475 --> 11:25.393
Thirty-three!

11:25.476 --> 11:26.644
Bitch!

11:26.727 --> 11:29.355
What's with that attitude?!

11:29.438 --> 11:32.274
Hey, this bet is off. Got that?

11:32.775 --> 11:36.153
Let's say that a meteorite falls
from the skies above

11:36.237 --> 11:38.656
into this yard right now.

11:39.156 --> 11:43.828
Then, you'll persuade to end the game,

11:44.412 --> 11:46.122
blaming it on the meteorite.

11:46.706 --> 11:48.082
Not to convince me,

11:48.582 --> 11:49.792
but yourselves.

11:50.418 --> 11:52.294
Does that sit well with you, though?

11:53.087 --> 11:55.673
Maybe you ran out of time

11:55.756 --> 11:59.427
because you took too long
to throw the ball.

12:00.136 --> 12:02.138
If you can honestly say

12:02.221 --> 12:05.266
that you didn't break
the rules of the game,

12:05.891 --> 12:07.143
then go ahead,

12:07.226 --> 12:09.228
end this game.

12:09.311 --> 12:10.146
Dammit…

12:10.229 --> 12:11.480
Ermes,

12:11.564 --> 12:14.066
you know you'll be thrown in
the Punishment Ward.

12:16.902 --> 12:19.405
Please, mister.

12:19.488 --> 12:21.574
Give me five… No, three minutes.

12:23.117 --> 12:26.120
I'll make another round,
so finish up in two minutes.

12:26.203 --> 12:27.705
F.F., hurry!

12:28.664 --> 12:32.918
But a measly 100 dollars
only pays for the ball.

12:33.794 --> 12:36.255
I'm putting the glove away. Give it to me!

12:36.338 --> 12:38.591
What?

12:40.176 --> 12:42.219
Goddammit!

12:46.515 --> 12:47.641
Shit…

12:49.769 --> 12:51.812
I attached a sticker to it

12:51.896 --> 12:53.773
in case something like this happens!

12:59.320 --> 13:00.446
Ermes!

13:03.616 --> 13:04.533
Whoa!

13:05.743 --> 13:07.119
Let's keep playing.

13:10.915 --> 13:13.042
I'm just watching.

13:14.251 --> 13:16.545
I won't interfere or object.

13:16.629 --> 13:19.632
And I can't prove anything, but…

13:22.009 --> 13:23.093
Ermes…

13:23.177 --> 13:25.221
She knows what she's done.

13:27.056 --> 13:28.682
Without a doubt,

13:28.766 --> 13:31.101
she violated the rules
of the game just now.

13:31.602 --> 13:32.686
I know this

13:34.063 --> 13:38.067
because Mary Lynn Manson,
the debt collector, appeared.

13:42.613 --> 13:43.697
Ermes!

13:43.781 --> 13:46.408
She's a Stand User!

13:51.789 --> 13:54.834
Mary Lynn Manson
will always collect the debt

13:54.917 --> 13:56.877
no matter where you hide it,

13:56.961 --> 13:58.712
or what it is. All of it.

14:00.631 --> 14:02.466
That's not enough.

14:03.092 --> 14:04.176
Smack…

14:06.303 --> 14:07.888
It's game over.

14:13.519 --> 14:15.938
Ermes!

14:25.072 --> 14:26.574
Ermes…

14:26.657 --> 14:28.909
If I sell this liver on the black market,

14:30.160 --> 14:33.372
it will compensate for
the remaining 590 dollars.

14:33.956 --> 14:34.999
Bastard!

14:35.082 --> 14:36.500
Take this!

14:39.503 --> 14:42.298
I am the shadow of Ermes's conscience.

14:42.381 --> 14:45.384
You cannot attack me.

14:45.968 --> 14:50.180
Ermes broke the rules and lost the bet.

14:50.764 --> 14:53.142
I only collected her debt.

14:53.809 --> 14:56.061
If you have any other valuable,

14:56.562 --> 14:59.189
I can exchange it for this liver.

14:59.982 --> 15:01.817
The bet's not over yet.

15:02.318 --> 15:03.402
What?

15:03.485 --> 15:05.529
One thousand throws.

15:05.613 --> 15:06.864
If I win,

15:06.947 --> 15:09.575
give back everything you took from her.

15:09.658 --> 15:11.535
Everything.

15:11.619 --> 15:15.539
Good. However, I hope you are prepared

15:15.623 --> 15:17.499
to wager something as valuable.

15:17.583 --> 15:18.626
I'm aware.

15:18.709 --> 15:19.960
Very well.

15:20.044 --> 15:21.795
The game has already started.

15:22.296 --> 15:23.672
I shall see you again.

15:24.798 --> 15:25.925
F.F.!

15:29.720 --> 15:30.638
Jolyne.

15:30.721 --> 15:32.932
Ermer, this wasn't your fault.

15:34.016 --> 15:35.851
Miraschon is a Stand User.

15:36.352 --> 15:39.063
Pale Snake must have a hand in this.

15:39.146 --> 15:44.443
She must be here to collect
my father's disc from me.

15:44.526 --> 15:48.530
Then you really shouldn't play this game.

15:48.614 --> 15:51.825
You got caught in
me and my father's problem.

15:52.451 --> 15:54.036
I can't let you die.

15:55.037 --> 15:56.997
But what are you going to do?

15:57.081 --> 15:58.874
A thousand throws?

15:58.958 --> 16:01.418
That Stand seems invincible.

16:02.127 --> 16:03.253
You're right.

16:03.754 --> 16:06.256
We'll chase Miraschon herself
and beat her!

16:08.008 --> 16:10.052
The Stand may be invincible,

16:10.135 --> 16:11.804
but Miraschon isn't.

16:12.638 --> 16:14.306
That's why she ran.

16:16.558 --> 16:17.476
Let's go!

16:26.610 --> 16:27.444
She's here.

16:27.528 --> 16:29.279
She must have entered this room.

16:29.363 --> 16:30.864
There's a door to the back.

16:30.948 --> 16:32.324
Maybe she escaped that way.

16:34.243 --> 16:35.077
F.F.!

16:36.870 --> 16:39.206
Jolyne, don't throw it yet!

16:42.835 --> 16:44.086
Crap!

16:44.169 --> 16:45.754
F.F.! It's coming towards you!

16:45.838 --> 16:47.881
Where is it? I can't see a thing!

16:47.965 --> 16:48.924
Don't move!

16:49.008 --> 16:50.384
The ball will hit you!

16:56.598 --> 16:58.559
Whoa! I got it!

16:58.642 --> 17:00.060
That was too close!

17:00.144 --> 17:01.186
Great job, F.F.

17:01.270 --> 17:03.439
Now, calm down so you can throw it back.

17:03.522 --> 17:04.648
I'm right here!

17:04.732 --> 17:06.734
-Where are you?
-Hurry!

17:08.360 --> 17:10.112
It's over for them.

17:11.071 --> 17:12.156
F.F.!

17:13.532 --> 17:15.284
I don't have time for this!

17:24.209 --> 17:25.919
F.F.

17:26.003 --> 17:27.796
I shot towards

17:27.880 --> 17:29.423
the direction of her voice.

17:29.506 --> 17:30.591
I didn't even aim!

17:32.134 --> 17:35.262
Dammit! What is she?

17:38.515 --> 17:40.100
Lockdown will soon commence.

17:40.184 --> 17:43.771
All inmates must return to their cells.

17:43.854 --> 17:47.274
Prepare for headcount.

17:47.775 --> 17:48.609
I repeat!

17:52.112 --> 17:53.238
She ran to the right!

18:03.874 --> 18:05.501
How unfortunate.

18:06.001 --> 18:07.294
You can't run anymore.

18:07.878 --> 18:10.255
Now that we know
that you are a Stand User,

18:10.339 --> 18:11.924
I won't hold back.

18:12.007 --> 18:13.258
Wait,

18:13.342 --> 18:14.676
I'll give it all back.

18:14.760 --> 18:15.719
The liver…

18:15.803 --> 18:16.929
and the money too!

18:17.012 --> 18:18.555
That's not enough.

18:18.639 --> 18:22.434
Who gave you that Stand ability?

18:22.518 --> 18:23.435
What?

18:24.561 --> 18:26.063
Pale Snake.

18:26.647 --> 18:29.358
It was him, wasn't it?
I want to know who his User is.

18:30.067 --> 18:31.568
What are you talking about?

18:31.652 --> 18:33.403
You shouldn't test me.

18:33.487 --> 18:34.822
I'm serious!

18:34.905 --> 18:38.325
I only wanted to go on parole!

18:44.832 --> 18:45.791
What is this?

18:46.750 --> 18:47.876
This is an elevator

18:48.377 --> 18:50.504
for transporting cafeteria food.

18:51.088 --> 18:52.631
How many more seconds?

18:52.714 --> 18:53.924
Six…

18:54.007 --> 18:55.634
No, is it five?

18:57.177 --> 18:58.220
Jolyne!

19:04.852 --> 19:05.978
Two seconds left…

19:07.521 --> 19:08.897
F.F, the ball!

19:09.773 --> 19:11.358
Throw it to me!

19:14.278 --> 19:15.112
Dammit!

19:18.407 --> 19:20.868
What's your next move?

19:22.202 --> 19:23.787
Eight seconds left.

19:23.871 --> 19:25.372
Seven, six…

19:30.711 --> 19:32.087
F.F.!

19:39.595 --> 19:42.848
Will this do, Miraschon?

19:43.891 --> 19:47.477
Such an easy and simple request.

19:47.561 --> 19:48.937
Feel free to ask me again.

19:59.198 --> 20:00.490
The game of catch

20:01.241 --> 20:03.118
was just interrupted.

20:03.744 --> 20:05.829
It's game over,

20:06.413 --> 20:08.749
Jolyne Cujoh!

20:09.625 --> 20:12.961
Mary Lynn Manson
will always collect what's owed!

20:13.545 --> 20:15.339
No matter where it is,

20:15.422 --> 20:17.257
even if you don't know where,

20:17.341 --> 20:19.301
Mary Lynn knows where it is.

20:19.384 --> 20:20.344
Jolyne!

20:21.303 --> 20:23.222
I'll take the most expensive organ.

20:23.305 --> 20:24.932
And for the remainder,

20:25.015 --> 20:27.226
your most prized possession,

20:27.309 --> 20:29.645
your father's disc.

20:30.229 --> 20:31.605
And the disc…

20:34.024 --> 20:38.362
was on her since the beginning!

20:39.404 --> 20:40.405
I won!

20:40.989 --> 20:42.115
Your organ,

20:42.824 --> 20:43.825
your disc…

20:43.909 --> 20:46.286
They're all mine now!

20:50.123 --> 20:51.833
The game of catch isn't over yet.

20:55.837 --> 20:57.547
But how?

20:58.298 --> 20:59.508
The ball…

21:12.562 --> 21:13.480
Impossible.

21:13.563 --> 21:15.482
-You broke the rules.
-No.

21:15.565 --> 21:18.568
We never agreed on my partner.

21:19.319 --> 21:20.570
The guard is okay too, right?

21:28.578 --> 21:30.747
The debt collector agrees with me.

21:33.125 --> 21:36.169
How many throws do I have left? Is it 800?

21:36.253 --> 21:37.587
Or 900?

21:37.671 --> 21:39.131
It's a pain to count.

21:39.798 --> 21:40.882
Let's say 1,000 throws.

21:56.648 --> 21:58.150
We did it!

22:05.282 --> 22:06.575
MIRASCHON
STAND: DEBT COLLECTOR MARY LYNN MANSON

22:06.658 --> 22:07.492
OUT OF COMMISSION

22:08.285 --> 22:10.787
I will return the disc to my father.

22:11.580 --> 22:14.458
Along with the other disc
that Pale Snake has.

22:14.541 --> 22:15.709
No matter what.

23:40.961 --> 23:45.966
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
